    },
    "body": "If you operate from more than one warehouse, you can set a filter to show you all of your routes or from a single warehouse.  If all of your routes are not shown on the routes page, check your filter first following the steps below.   From the Dispatch Console: 1.  In the Dispatch Console: Settings > Preferences.    2.  Choose \"Display Preference.\"    3.  From the dropdown list choose “All” or a single warehouse to display on the routes page.  Click \"Save.\"    From the Mobile App: 1.  Click the Dispatch tab.  Click the Menu Bars on the top right of the screen.    2,  Click Settings > Preferences    3.  Choose Display Preference    4.  From the dropdown list choose “All” or a single warehouse to display on the routes page.  Click \"Save.\"  Video:  Display Preference - Set Warehouse Filter",
